夫人，生魯桓公。十八年，武公卒，子宣公力立。","chapter_id":"c-shiji-038-song","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-038","source_id":"s-shiji-038-song"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-038-song:p035","quote":"桓公二年，諸矦伐宋，至郊而去。三年，齊桓公始霸。二十三年，迎衛公子燬於齊，立之，是爲衛文公。文公女弟爲桓公夫人。秦穆公即位。三十年，桓公病，太子茲甫讓其庶兄目夷爲嗣。桓公義太子意，竟不聽。三十一年春，桓公卒，太子茲甫立，是爲襄公。以其庶兄目夷爲相。未葬，而齊桓公會諸矦于葵丘，襄公往會。","chapter_id":"c-shiji-038-song","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-038","source_id":"s-shiji-038-song"}],"rationale":"宋武公女嫁魯惠公與衛文公女弟為宋桓公夫人不同國別婚姻角色。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:p027","text":"三十四年，戴公卒，子武公司空立。武公生女爲魯惠公夫人，生魯桓公。十八年，武公卒，子宣公力立。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m027-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"戴公","kind":"person","person_id":"2v6_0g1_ve2_AAAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m027-0010","start":10,"end":14,"surface":"武公司空","kind":"person","person_id":"2v6_0g1_ve2_AAAAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m027-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"武公","kind":"person","person_id":"2v6_0g1_ve2_AAAAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m027-0021","start":21,"end":24,"surface":"魯惠公","kind":"person","person_id":"lc6_cup_v9c_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m027-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"2v6_0g1_ve2_AAAAAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m027-0028","start":28,"end":31,"surface":"魯桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"lc6_cup_v9c_AB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m027-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"武公","kind":"person","person_id":"2v6_0g1_ve2_AAAAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m027-0041","start":41,"end":44,"surface":"宣公力","kind":"person","person_id":"2v6_0g1_ve2_AAAAAAAAAB","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-038-song","book_id":"b-shiji-038","